# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Source renders — 108MB of 8000-10000px originals.
#
# Deliberately excluded: the derived AVIF/WebP variants the site actually
# serves are committed under site/public/renders (7.5MB) and site/public/team,
# so the build and the deploy work without them. Keeping the originals out
# keeps clones fast.
#
# They are only needed to re-run `npm run images` after adding or replacing a
# render. If you want them versioned, use Git LFS:
#   git lfs install && git lfs track "Images/*.jpg" && git add .gitattributes
# then delete the line below.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Images/

# Static export output
out/
